Package: CVDLINK OmicsQC
Type: Package
Title: Simple omics quality control pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Urmo Võsa, Andres Veidenberg
Maintainer: Andres Veidenberg <andres.veidenberg@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a lightweight quality control workflow for generic omics
    assay matrices and sample metadata. The package runs built-in sanity
    checks, calculates sample-level QC summaries, and integrates validate rule
    files so project-specific checks can be added without changing code.
